{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A backpack is positioned on the bottom side of the layout. For every sandwich present, there is a cutting board located above the backpack and a pizza to the right of the cutting board. The sandwich is placed above the pizza, and the backpack is larger than the sandwich.",
